@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check: is the app running?
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 1. Create event → 201 Created
# @name createEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jazz Night",
  "venue": "Meistersingerhalle Nuremberg",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-12T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-03-12T22:00:00Z"
}
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "The Neighbourhood",
  "venue": "Uber Arena",
  "startsAt": "2027-05-12T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-05-12T23:00:00Z"
}

### 2. List all events → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### 3. Get the event created in request 1 → 200
# Send request 1 first: the id is taken from its response
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}

### 4. Unknown event → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/999999

### 5. Blank name → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "venue": "Meistersingerhalle Nuremberg",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-12T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-03-12T22:00:00Z"
}

### 6. Start in the past → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jazz Night",
  "venue": "Meistersingerhalle Nuremberg",
  "startsAt": "2020-03-12T19:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2020-03-12T22:00:00Z"
}

### 7. End before start → 400 expected
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jazz Night",
  "venue": "Meistersingerhalle Nuremberg",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-12T22:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-03-12T19:00:00Z"
}

### 8. Missing fields → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jazz Night"
}
